    "purpose": "The native node types, the one source for the internal markdown_core_node_type enum and every per-type table in core/ and elements/. Each class is numbered in list order from 1, so append a type to the end of its class. `kind` names the canonical AST kind (docs/specs/canonical-ast.json) the facade reports, or null for a private type; `record` is the C type of the payload the node allocates inline, or null; `structure` names the MARKDOWN_CORE_ELEMENT_* descriptor that defines the type's block or inline structure, or null. The type string is the lowercased name. Run scripts/tooling/generate-node-kinds.mjs after editing.",
